- op: discuss  # 6435
  at: '2026-03-06T00:49:14Z'  # 6435
  by: agent  # 6435
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6435
  clock: 3  # 6435
  nonce: '6435'  # 6435
  message: "Root cause analysis complete. Fix would require changes to scripts/auto-pr (governance file). The fix: auto-pr should not force-push rebased commits to existing PRs when a tracker sync may be in flight. Instead, it should check for TRACKER_SYNC_PENDING before rebasing. Requesting approval to modify scripts/auto-pr."  # 6435
